Package: SignalAdaptiveStudy
Type: Package
Title: Signal-Adaptive Ridge and LASSO in PatientLevelPrediction
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Egill", "Fridgeirsson", email = "egillax@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A study package that adds signal-adaptive ridge (SAR) and signal-adaptive LASSO (SAL) logistic
    regression to PatientLevelPrediction. Each feature's penalty depends on its prevalence and its marginal
    association with the outcome, computed from the training rows of each fit.
